    hand or face-up field instead. Once per turn, if your opponent Special Summons
    a monster(s), you can: Immediately after this effect resolves, Xyz Summon 1 FIRE
    Xyz Monster using only "Fire King" monsters you control. You can only activate
    1 "Fire King Sanctuary" per turn.'
